AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_0000001 "Computer software, or generally just software, is any set of machine-readable instructions (most often in the form of a computer program) that conform to a given syntax (sometimes referred to as a language) that is interpretable by a given processor and that directs a computer's processor to perform specific operations.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:SWO_0000001 "James Malone")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:SWO_0000001 "Modified in parts from https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software")
