# Class: obo:SWO_3000010 (DXF)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_3000010 "DXF (Drawing Interchange Format, or Drawing Exchange Format) is a CAD data file format developed by Autodesk for enabling data interoperability between AutoCAD and other programs.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:SWO_3000010 "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AutoCAD_DXF")
