AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "https://satijalab.org/seurat/"@en) Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100130 "Seurat is an R package designed for QC, analysis, and exploration of single-cell RNA-seq data. Seurat aims to enable users to identify and interpret sources of heterogeneity from single-cell transcriptomic measurements, and to integrate diverse types of single-cell data."@en)
