AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "https://htseq.readthedocs.io/en/release_0.11.1/overview.html") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100140 "HTSeq is a Python package that provides infrastructure to process data from high-throughput sequencing assays.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:SWO_1100140 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:SWO_1100140 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:SWO_1100140 "Mark Reuter")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "Mark Reuter") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100141 "RNA-SeQC is a java program which computes a series of quality control metrics for RNA-seq data. The input can be one or more BAM files. The output consists of HTML reports and tab delimited files of metrics data. This program can be valuable for comparing sequencing quality across different samples or experiments to evaluate different experimental parameters. It can also be run on individual samples as a means of quality control before continuing with downstream analysis.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:SWO_1100141 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:SWO_1100141 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:SWO_1100141 "Mark Reuter")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "http://rseqc.sourceforge.net/") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100142 "RSeQC package provides a number of useful modules that can comprehensively evaluate high throughput sequence data especially RNA-seq data. Some basic modules quickly inspect sequence quality, nucleotide composition bias, PCR bias and GC bias, while RNA-seq specific modules evaluate sequencing saturation, mapped reads distribution, coverage uniformity, strand specificity, transcript level RNA integrity etc.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:SWO_1100142 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:SWO_1100142 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:SWO_1100142 "Mark Reuter")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "Mark Reuter") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100143 "SAM Tools provide various utilities for manipulating alignments in the SAM format, including sorting, merging, indexing and generating alignments in a per-position format.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:SWO_1100143 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:SWO_1100143 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:SWO_1100143 "Mark Reuter")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "Mark Reuter") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100144 "FastQC aims to provide a simple way to do some quality control checks on raw sequence data coming from high throughput sequencing pipelines. It provides a modular set of analyses which you can use to give a quick impression of whether your data has any problems of which you should be aware before doing any further analysis.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:SWO_1100144 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:SWO_1100144 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:SWO_1100144 "Mark Reuter")
